## Extracted design

The report shell in src/harness/report/templates/report.html (the "V9" developer-console design:
styles, layout, navigation palette, section structure and the sample content
shown in demonstration mode) is extracted and adapted from the legacy ai-harness
project, file src/report/templates/local-report-v9.html at commit
f5d5f84b9006b628778983dab56dd92dc8888156
(https://github.com/samartomar/ai-harness/tree/f5d5f84b9006b628778983dab56dd92dc8888156).
That project is Copyright 2026 The AI Harness (aih) authors and is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the source file: product naming and legacy commands were removed from
the shell, the baked-in sample sections remain only as the labelled demonstration
sample, a hydration function and a few styles were added, and the radar and heatmap
scripts were guarded so they only run when their elements exist. No source from the
legacy report engine, digest types or collectors is used.

## Adapted redaction patterns

The credential-shaped redaction patterns in src/harness/report/data.mjs are also
adapted from the Apache-2.0 legacy ai-harness project at the revision above.
They were re-authored for portable structured-data projection without host or
environment access; they do not import the legacy engine or its collectors.

## Fonts and third-party assets

The design uses system font stacks only. No font files, images or third-party
scripts are embedded or loaded.
